{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_020_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:257d1395be223c98fdf41b5b1311559fdded0531d9a97060b7cf9132ea66bc4f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:497e2f65c4ac24271a7711d9471ea9370bba0565d2154eec5302f47c60ee0de9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n今年的巧克力也多谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f446903fe1b97a60322a1395246ef37039cabc6e35760b1a72250c2ef6766cf",
      "text": "明明看起来那么忙，今年也为我准备了\n巧克力……我真的超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd65452bfd983848f5acb89520be2d6c23ddb431cfaec77c19b7293551f47182",
      "text": "那是当然了！因为很希望能让你开心嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f79d0e0d08a249537adf4050ff0a62e0f807ad11dcf7a9ef8a4240c523dcdf32",
      "text": "这样啊，嘿嘿……制作人，\n果然好温柔啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fe0c8dd19e95a0088873e39712f6917d57de8a9574d17de2c31eee4658d32b3",
      "text": "去年的巧克力，\n我也觉得超级开心来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffab77aa4f3c0d804714ddec53e4d2b866f44be553445b54e27d4358af2bbfe2",
      "text": "但今年不仅如此，\n总觉得心里痒痒的……为什么会这样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e62806e292031afca2f4e6bb1e64e306b70666184c4ecbb26267558723e76011",
      "text": "一想到这是制作人特意为我挑选的，\n情绪一下子就高涨起来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f5ac4b3094f4c311ad211cc5f6d92a2996618808c95d9d89771cbc3f080a06c",
      "text": "啊，在这么个地方拉着你站着说话抱歉啦！\n一得意忘形，不知不觉就说得太多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:505c6f614829c0b891e8335f3d6bb9dd3b5e4077dc8c8f50fc626199e6609af4",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，我要带回家好好珍惜着吃！\n我也想慢慢品尝嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_23:5_01_020_23_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18181cdc6a8f86a6fc70ee2f9b0b1cd83ae58db05d5f2be0761d5ca0f125b4cb",
      "text": "好嘞——今天的工作我也要加油啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
